@lang en

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `uk-interpretation-time`
IMPORT `uk-interpretation-application`
IMPORT `uk-interpretation-repeals`
IMPORT `uk-interpretation-general`
IMPORT `uk-interpretation-eu`
IMPORT `uk-interpretation-devolved`

-- Tests for uk-interpretation-devolved.l4. Each expected value was decided by reading the section and written down before the module was run.
-- The days the Act refers to without giving are INPUTS. The tests take "exit day" to be 31 January 2020, "IP completion day" 31 December 2020, the day section 20A
-- came into force 1 January 2021 and the day section 45 of the Fisheries Act 2020 came into force 1 March 2021; each is an illustration that the tests pick, and not a claim about the Act that gives it.


§ `Section 23ZA(1): assimilated direct legislation`

-- "except sections 1 to 4, 13 and 19(2)"
