#ASSERT REFUSED `section 23ZA(2)(a) — the Sovereign a reference is to be construed as` FALSE FALSE BECAUSE "section 10 gives no Sovereign unless the reference is to the Sovereign reigning at the time of the passing of the Act and no contrary intention appears"
