#ASSERT NOT `section 23ZA(2)(c) provides that it may be instituted, continued, enforced or imposed as if the repeal had not been made` `an investigation, legal proceeding or remedy in respect of such a right, privilege, obligation, liability, penalty, forfeiture or punishment` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `section 23ZA(2)(c) provides that it may be instituted, continued, enforced or imposed as if the repeal had not been made` `anything not in force or existing at the time at which the repeal takes effect` FALSE
