-- (6) "corresponding time" is the time the amending Act, subordinate legislation or devolution legislation was passed or made
#ASSERT `section 23ZA(6) — the corresponding time` (`An enactment` WITH `its kind` IS `an Act`, `the day it was passed or made` IS (YMD 2021 3 3), `what it says about coming into force` IS `no provision`) EQUALS (YMD 2021 3 3)
#ASSERT `section 23ZA(6) — the corresponding time` (`An enactment` WITH `its kind` IS `subordinate legislation`, `the day it was passed or made` IS (YMD 2022 4 4), `what it says about coming into force` IS `no provision`) EQUALS (YMD 2022 4 4)
